1
00:01:32,850 --> 00:01:34,960
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,780
[Episode 31]

3
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,590
So,

4
00:01:46,070 --> 00:01:47,430
you overheard

5
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:51,150
Li Rongzhang and the Zhang family
plotting to assassinate Murong Feng,

6
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:52,610
and you wanted to warn him,

7
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:54,310
which is why you were harmed?

8
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:56,509
Yes.

9
00:01:59,229 --> 00:02:00,400
Zhang Chuanqi

10
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,870
urged Li Rongzhang

11
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:05,040
to assassinate Murong Feng
at the opening ceremony

12
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,640
of the North-South Railway.

13
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:10,120
At that time,

14
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,810
both families already knew

15
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:14,810
the babies had been switched.

16
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:18,800
But Cheng Jinzhi couldn't
bear to part with Li Boze,

17
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,860
so they hadn't been swapped back yet.

18
00:02:22,310 --> 00:02:23,640
I had a feeling in my guts

19
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,050
that this matter

20
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,440
would be bad for my biological parents.

21
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,079
So,

22
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,560
I wanted to run to the Murong family

23
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,560
to warn them.

24
00:02:36,470 --> 00:02:38,070
Li Rongzhang didn't notice,

25
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,240
but Zhang Mingshu did.

26
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,610
He didn't say anything,

27
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,520
but sent someone

28
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,400
to intercept me halfway,

29
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:49,230
force-fed me poison,

30
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,810
and threw me into the river.

31
00:02:59,190 --> 00:03:00,150
Fortunately...

32
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,540
Fortunately you saved me.

33
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,490
But because of that,

34
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:21,250
the Ren family was implicated

35
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,650
and harmed by Zhang Mingshu
who came after me.

36
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:27,130
Although I reached the Murong residence,

37
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,490
the poison took effect at the door.

38
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,150
I looked terrifying

39
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:35,480
and was rejected by my biological parents.

40
00:03:35,990 --> 00:03:37,150
Naturally,

41
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,280
they wouldn't believe

42
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,520
the words of a mad child.

43
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,860
You remember everything?

44
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:48,360
Yeah.

45
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:50,910
Over the years,

46
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:53,079
the poison has somewhat

47
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,120
clouded my memory.

48
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:59,210
There were only a few fleeting images.

49
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,870
I had even forgotten

50
00:04:00,870 --> 00:04:02,080
who the murderer was.

51
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:04,280
But because of that,

52
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,640
the Zhang family didn't target me anymore.

53
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,940
Although the past few days
have been agonizing,

54
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,960
it's a blessing in disguise.

55
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:17,320
I finally remember everything.

56
00:04:26,270 --> 00:04:27,040
Susu,

57
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,310
back then I...

58
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:32,040
I know.

59
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:36,000
You feared the Zhang family's pursuers

60
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,530
would implicate my family,

61
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,190
so you secretly ran away.

62
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:46,360
What you said to me back then

63
00:04:46,750 --> 00:04:48,810
was to prevent me from pestering you.

64
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,390
I never expected

65
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,630
Zhang Mingshu to be so vicious.

66
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:04,080
He'd rather kill the wrong person
than let anyone slip away.

67
00:05:09,310 --> 00:05:10,160
I'm sorry.

68
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,390
Don't apologize.

69
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:15,960
It's not your fault.

70
00:05:16,950 --> 00:05:18,430
You were just a child

71
00:05:18,430 --> 00:05:20,160
driven to a dead end back then.

72
00:05:24,270 --> 00:05:26,270
Even if Zhang Mingshu hadn't acted,

73
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:28,240
the fire he set

74
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,640
to cover up the explosion

75
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,490
would still have burned down the wharf

76
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:34,970
and implicated my family.

77
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,250
The only difference is,

78
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,880
I would've perished alongside my parents.

79
00:05:58,750 --> 00:05:59,870
From now on,

80
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,800
stop saying

81
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,430
you're cold and ruthless.

82
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,950
If you were really that cold and ruthless,

83
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:07,560
would you have stayed
at the aviation school all this time?

84
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,870
Be nice,

85
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:10,470
and stop being so difficult.

86
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,680
Right back at you.

87
00:06:18,750 --> 00:06:20,080
Can I ask you something?

88
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,310
If I died,

89
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,480
what would you do?

90
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,040
Well, I would take Le'an

91
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,390
to a beautiful place

92
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,800
and live happily.

93
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:42,120
What a heartless thing to say!

94
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,680
Still,

95
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:50,430
I'm relieved

96
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,920
to hear you say that.

97
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,680
Don't worry.

98
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,270
Before we leave,

99
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:07,870
we will hold

100
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,290
a spectacular funeral for you.

101
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,000
The headstone

102
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,460
won't bear the Murong name

103
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,190
or the Li name,

104
00:07:17,510 --> 00:07:18,510
just these words:

105
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:22,560
"Here Lies the Greatest Bastard on Earth."

106
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,270
What?

107
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,810
Is it that great to be a bastard's wife?

108
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,120
No way.

109
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,040
Try again.

110
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,240
Don't die.

111
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:39,120
The wound has scabbed over.

112
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,919
You've finally pulled through.

113
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,870
How's everything at the aviation school

114
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:44,930
during my illness?

115
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,510
Don't worry.

116
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:48,200
Among the first batch
of poisoned students,

117
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,860
some have recovered like you.

118
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,790
I've placed them

119
00:08:51,790 --> 00:08:53,190
in a separate classroom.

120
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:56,200
They can move around freely
after three days of observation.

121
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,870
Their wounds have scabbed over,

122
00:08:57,870 --> 00:09:00,270
so there's basically no risk of infection.

123
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,640
The outbreak has peaked,

124
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:04,500
and casualties are dropping.

125
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,510
They probably just
wanted to force you to surrender.

126
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:08,870
They intentionally controlled the dosage

127
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:10,330
and didn't go for the kill.

128
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:13,200
But there's really no telling

129
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:15,440
whether they'll keep poisoning us.

130
00:09:16,070 --> 00:09:17,390
All we can do right now

131
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,150
is to

132
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,750
have the healthy students
take turns patrolling

133
00:09:21,750 --> 00:09:23,080
and keep a closer watch.

134
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,930
It's pretty much what we expected.

135
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:30,480
I wonder how Li Boze is getting on.

136
00:09:53,270 --> 00:09:54,750
Young Marshal Li has ordered that

137
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:57,440
as long as Murong Qingyi
hands over control of the aviation school,

138
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,500
he will let you off.

139
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:00,550
If you want to
take over the aviation school,

140
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:02,390
you'll have to step over our dead bodies!

141
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:03,440
This is our aviation school!

142
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,320
We will never back down!

143
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,440
Never back down!

144
00:10:05,550 --> 00:10:06,480
Never back down!

145
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,720
Never back down!

146
00:10:07,910 --> 00:10:09,630
Your principal is hiding

147
00:10:09,630 --> 00:10:11,150
and letting you come out to die.

148
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:13,150
Now the Li family
is more powerful than the Murong family.

149
00:10:13,150 --> 00:10:14,510
Why are you being so stubborn?

150
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:16,960
Zhenhua Aviation School
is a national aviation school,

151
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,510
not a tool for your struggles.

152
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:18,910
Right!

153
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:19,720
We support the principal,

154
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,200
not because his surname is Murong,

155
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,270
but because we admire

156
00:10:22,270 --> 00:10:23,600
Principal Qingyu's
philosophy of running the school,

157
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,480
his rigorous scholarship,

158
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,030
and Principal Qingyi's bravery

159
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:26,910
for the country and the people.

160
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:28,240
We will never allow the aviation school

161
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,000
to become an accomplice to traitors!

162
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,720
We are ready
to sacrifice ourselves at any time!

163
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,750
What we fear least is death.

164
00:10:32,750 --> 00:10:33,270
Right?

165
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:34,000
Right!

166
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,150
We're not afraid of death!

167
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:37,150
We're not afraid of death!

168
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,080
Bad news!

169
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:42,490
Li Boze has surrounded
the aviation school with the Ying Army.

170
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,490
Aren't the Ying Army

171
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:47,360
infected too?

172
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:49,320
Zhang Mingshu must have promised them

173
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,600
the antidote.

174
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,840
He's sitting back and watching us fight.

175
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,500
No matter who wins between us,

176
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,060
he will reap the benefits.

177
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,240
Are we

178
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,930
just going to be manipulated
by the Zhang family like this?

179
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:07,360
The antidote
is in the hands of the Zhang family.

180
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,200
We're

181
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,030
in a dead end.

182
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,730
Where are you going?

183
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:24,870
It's time

184
00:11:25,790 --> 00:11:27,250
to settle scores with him.

185
00:11:29,330 --> 00:11:30,510
I'll go with you.

186
00:11:36,790 --> 00:11:37,630
You stay here.

187
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,510
I'll be right back.

188
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,960
Ms. Ye.

189
00:11:53,790 --> 00:11:55,030
No matter what happens,

190
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:55,960
do not resist.

191
00:11:56,910 --> 00:11:57,720
Surviving

192
00:11:57,910 --> 00:11:59,640
is the only way to have a chance.

193
00:12:08,750 --> 00:12:09,630
Move! Move!

194
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:12,870
Young Marshal.

195
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:14,360
Murong Qingyi isn't coming out.

196
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,630
We are blocked by these people
who are not afraid of death.

197
00:12:15,630 --> 00:12:16,630
What should we do?

198
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:21,130
Those who have never
faced death fear it not.

199
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:22,790
Even if you kill us all,

200
00:12:22,790 --> 00:12:24,320
we will never surrender
the aviation school to you!

201
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:26,120
Is there any justice left?

202
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:27,790
Traitor!

203
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:30,220
Traitor!

204
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:32,270
Traitor!

205
00:12:32,790 --> 00:12:35,030
Traitor!

206
00:12:35,750 --> 00:12:37,240
Traitor!

207
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,960
Murong Qingyi!

208
00:12:44,550 --> 00:12:46,030
Every minute you hide,

209
00:12:47,270 --> 00:12:49,270
a student dies.

210
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:52,630
I won't stop until you show your face!

211
00:12:59,000 --> 00:12:59,840
Li Boze!

212
00:13:28,670 --> 00:13:29,720
What do you want?

213
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:40,030
Marshal Li sacrificed himself for justice.

214
00:13:40,030 --> 00:13:40,720
Is this

215
00:13:40,870 --> 00:13:42,670
the traitor he died for?

216
00:13:42,670 --> 00:13:46,400
-How dare you mention my father?
-You don't deserve to mention him!

217
00:13:46,670 --> 00:13:48,360
You're nothing but a henchman for evil.

218
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,560
You deserve to be despised by everyone!

219
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:53,960
Oh, come on!

220
00:13:54,850 --> 00:13:56,840
Cut the crap!

221
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,860
You really think I won't kill you?

222
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,400
Open the gate!

223
00:14:14,030 --> 00:14:14,630
Come on!

224
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:15,840
Kill me!

225
00:14:24,510 --> 00:14:26,630
I'm not just gonna kill you today.

226
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:30,550
I'm killing all of you.

227
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:44,870
Fire!

228
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,510
I said, fire!

229
00:14:56,910 --> 00:14:58,000
Put your guns down!

230
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:09,630
Raise your guns!

231
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,200
What are you doing?

232
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,060
What am I doing?

233
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:16,320
How could Marshal Li
raise such a wretch like you?

234
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,790
I don't want the antidote anymore.

235
00:15:17,790 --> 00:15:18,850
Kill me if you want!

236
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,630
No matter how tyrannical Marshal Li was,

237
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:23,760
he'd never do such a despicable thing!

238
00:15:44,670 --> 00:15:46,400
You're very proud, aren't you?

239
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:49,240
Unfortunately, today,

240
00:15:51,270 --> 00:15:53,000
you must die.

241
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,630
Brother,

242
00:16:05,510 --> 00:16:06,970
acting ruthless and crazy

243
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,910
isn't what you're good at.

244
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:10,670
Who?

245
00:16:11,390 --> 00:16:12,720
Who is your Brother?

246
00:16:14,510 --> 00:16:16,030
Who says we're family?

247
00:16:18,630 --> 00:16:19,750
My family

248
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,790
has long been destroyed by you.

249
00:16:28,210 --> 00:16:29,740
You finally see it clearly.

250
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:33,720
Neither the Li family
nor the Murong family

251
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:36,770
has ever known
true filial piety and parental love.

252
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:39,080
What you want to protect

253
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:41,890
has always been nothing but an illusion.

254
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,960
Your kindness,

255
00:16:51,420 --> 00:16:52,480
your innocence,

256
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,000
and your actions

257
00:16:55,790 --> 00:16:58,050
are all just covering up your cowardice.

258
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:30,730
Principal! Principal! Principal!

259
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,830
Principal! Principal! Principal!

260
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:34,510
-Principal!
-Principal!

261
00:17:46,030 --> 00:17:46,920
Principal!

262
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,790
-Principal!
-Principal!

263
00:17:48,790 --> 00:17:49,590
Qingyi!

264
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,110
Principal!

265
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:52,240
Principal, wake up!

266
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,900
-Principal!
-Principal!

267
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:56,160
Qingyi!

268
00:17:58,070 --> 00:17:59,030
Qingyi!

269
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,350
Qingyi!

270
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,070
Wake up!

271
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:11,270
Qingyi, wake up!

272
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,590
Qingyi!

273
00:18:21,510 --> 00:18:23,400
Qingyi, wake up!

274
00:18:25,270 --> 00:18:26,680
Please.

275
00:18:29,110 --> 00:18:30,270
Wake up!

276
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:37,920
Qingyi!

277
00:18:42,930 --> 00:18:47,450
[East Asia Chamber of Commerce]

278
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,440
Young Marshal Li
has joined us for the antidote.

279
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:52,000
And he even killed Murong Qingyi.

280
00:18:52,750 --> 00:18:53,920
That should be

281
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:55,760
proof enough of his sincerity.

282
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,160
Then let the Ying Army

283
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,880
and your Zhang family

284
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,730
take over the aviation school.

285
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:05,890
Understood.

286
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:21,750
Young Marshal Li,

287
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:23,480
you really have

288
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,590
extraordinary courage.

289
00:19:26,030 --> 00:19:26,830
As it happens,

290
00:19:27,550 --> 00:19:29,830
I've got a problem.

291
00:19:30,270 --> 00:19:31,550
I wonder

292
00:19:32,070 --> 00:19:34,920
if you'd help me settle it.

293
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,480
Please speak.

294
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,400
Bring her up.

295
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:55,940
What is this about?

296
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:00,720
I sincerely asked her to sing for me,

297
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:02,240
but

298
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,880
Boss Hai refused.

299
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:06,350
I heard

300
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:10,200
you two are old friends.

301
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:11,720
Can you

302
00:20:12,830 --> 00:20:13,830
talk her round?

303
00:20:19,830 --> 00:20:20,480
Bah!

304
00:20:22,310 --> 00:20:24,910
Singing for a scoundrel like you
is bad enough,

305
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:27,300
yet you want me to sing A River All Red?

306
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:28,940
Even if I could sing it,

307
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:30,640
do you deserve to listen?

308
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:31,510
Behave!

309
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:43,240
Boss Hai is so unyielding.

310
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,070
Then

311
00:20:45,590 --> 00:20:47,830
don't ever sing again.

312
00:20:48,750 --> 00:20:49,350
Come here.

313
00:21:18,350 --> 00:21:19,030
Stop!

314
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:24,550
Young Marshal Li,

315
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:28,070
you really cherish old friendships.

316
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:30,510
But

317
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:33,440
if you keep being so lenient,

318
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:35,480
why would the Chamber of Commerce

319
00:21:35,480 --> 00:21:37,480
risk giving you

320
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,960
the antidote?

321
00:21:42,070 --> 00:21:43,800
Chairman, you misunderstood.

322
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,440
This woman

323
00:21:48,790 --> 00:21:51,650
has attempted to assassinate
my father many times.

324
00:21:54,350 --> 00:21:55,590
I still have

325
00:21:57,350 --> 00:21:58,550
some scores

326
00:21:59,790 --> 00:22:01,480
to settle with her myself.

327
00:22:21,830 --> 00:22:22,640
Boss Hai,

328
00:22:23,510 --> 00:22:25,590
we haven't known each other for long,

329
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:27,160
but I have to admit

330
00:22:28,110 --> 00:22:29,160
the first time I saw you,

331
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:31,560
I felt a strange curiosity
I couldn't name.

332
00:22:32,030 --> 00:22:35,000
There's something about it,
something hard to describe,

333
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:37,730
that makes me want to know
just who you really are.

334
00:22:37,750 --> 00:22:38,680
From now on,

335
00:22:38,990 --> 00:22:40,720
you can treat me as your family.

336
00:22:54,010 --> 00:22:54,940
Open your mouth.

337
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:58,130
Open your mouth!

338
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,160
Stop.

339
00:23:11,590 --> 00:23:13,030
I said, stop!

340
00:23:14,110 --> 00:23:16,070
I still want to keep

341
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,590
Boss Hai's voice

342
00:23:19,070 --> 00:23:21,310
so I can hear her sing A River All Red.

343
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,310
Li Boze.

344
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,970
Kill me if you have the guts.

345
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:45,680
Hai Tangqing.

346
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:53,000
You killed my father.

347
00:23:53,550 --> 00:23:55,810
Do you think
I would let you die so easily?

348
00:23:57,270 --> 00:23:58,110
How have I

349
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:00,320
treated you all these years?

350
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,480
And how have you

351
00:24:03,310 --> 00:24:05,000
treated me in return?

352
00:24:06,790 --> 00:24:07,350
Get lost!

353
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:11,070
Li Boze!

354
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,000
You traitor!

355
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:16,640
Where's the justice you claim to uphold?

356
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,310
Let me tell you.

357
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:21,240
My father

358
00:24:21,750 --> 00:24:22,830
is dead.

359
00:24:25,310 --> 00:24:27,510
And the Murong family has fallen apart.

360
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:32,030
I've got nothing left!

361
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,920
Your so-called fairness,

362
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:37,000
justice,

363
00:24:37,960 --> 00:24:39,830
decency, and kindness

364
00:24:40,310 --> 00:24:41,790
are all bullshit!

365
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:44,310
Call me a lackey

366
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:46,350
or a traitor. I don't care!

367
00:24:47,440 --> 00:24:49,500
I will rely on the Chamber of Commerce

368
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:53,790
to revive the Li family's influence,

369
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:57,650
so my father's lifelong efforts
shall not be in vain.

370
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,460
Do you understand?

371
00:25:01,750 --> 00:25:02,440
Guards!

372
00:25:03,070 --> 00:25:04,830
Send this woman to Dongjiadu.

373
00:25:05,350 --> 00:25:08,480
Washing clothes and emptying pots
for others will suit her well.

374
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,030
Yes, sir!

375
00:25:10,920 --> 00:25:11,440
Get up!

376
00:25:26,030 --> 00:25:26,960
Thank you

377
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:29,840
for capturing this woman

378
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:31,420
and bringing her to me.

379
00:25:32,830 --> 00:25:35,430
I will torture this woman
in every way possible

380
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:37,830
to make her wish she were dead.

381
00:25:37,830 --> 00:25:40,560
It's the least I can do
to pay tribute to my father.

382
00:25:42,830 --> 00:25:45,290
Thank you
for making this happen, Chairman.

383
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:50,350
Good!

384
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:52,720
Well done!

385
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,750
Take your men

386
00:25:57,590 --> 00:25:59,070
and go get the antidote.

387
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:02,200
Young Marshal Li,

388
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:05,830
you're a completely different person now.

389
00:26:06,590 --> 00:26:09,350
But regarding your father's end,

390
00:26:13,830 --> 00:26:15,030
you'd better not

391
00:26:15,160 --> 00:26:16,830
follow in his footsteps.

392
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:20,040
I will keep your words in mind

393
00:26:21,510 --> 00:26:23,770
and fully serve the Chamber of Commerce.

394
00:26:55,110 --> 00:26:55,970
Young Marshal.

395
00:26:56,350 --> 00:26:58,440
Half of the antidote
sent by the Zhang family has been used,

396
00:26:58,440 --> 00:26:59,700
and there is some left.

397
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:02,160
Division Commander Tang and the others

398
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:04,200
are all veterans
who served the late Marshal.

399
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:06,720
Punishing them severely
might shake the army's morale.

400
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:08,270
How about giving the remaining antidote

401
00:27:08,270 --> 00:27:09,270
to them?

402
00:27:10,550 --> 00:27:11,440
Call them in.

403
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:11,970
Yes, sir.

404
00:27:12,350 --> 00:27:13,030
Bring them in.

405
00:27:13,030 --> 00:27:13,550
Move!

406
00:27:17,750 --> 00:27:18,270
Kneel!

407
00:27:25,550 --> 00:27:27,010
Division Commander Tang.

408
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:30,550
Do you still remember

409
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:33,120
the laws of the Ying Army?

410
00:27:35,030 --> 00:27:36,590
Any person who disobeys orders
in the presence of the enemy

411
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:38,190
or leads troops to surrender

412
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:40,000
shall be punished by death.

413
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,550
Those guilty of cowardice before the enemy

414
00:27:41,550 --> 00:27:43,750
shall be subject to summary execution.

415
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:46,090
Since you know that,

416
00:27:47,310 --> 00:27:48,840
why did you disobey orders?

417
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:52,610
The teachers and students
of the aviation school are not the enemy.

418
00:27:54,030 --> 00:27:55,270
Are you saying

419
00:27:56,440 --> 00:27:58,700
that the Ying Army under my father's rule

420
00:27:59,350 --> 00:28:01,010
is actually a righteous army?

421
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:03,200
You still have the nerve
to mention Marshal Li.

422
00:28:03,200 --> 00:28:04,130
I'm telling you,

423
00:28:04,880 --> 00:28:06,960
Marshal Li might be ruthless,

424
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:09,640
but he'd never sell out his own country.

425
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:13,110
You

426
00:28:13,440 --> 00:28:15,240
don't deserve to lead the Ying Army,

427
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:16,840
much less claim to be his son!

428
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:17,790
Fine.

429
00:28:18,790 --> 00:28:20,320
Since you refuse to repent,

430
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:23,200
I'll give you another gift.

431
00:28:25,070 --> 00:28:26,750
I remember the Chamber of Commerce

432
00:28:26,750 --> 00:28:29,210
needs to conduct human experiments, right?

433
00:28:31,550 --> 00:28:32,200
Liu Zhou,

434
00:28:33,720 --> 00:28:36,240
send them all to the
Zhang family's pharmaceutical factory

435
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,240
for experiments.

436
00:28:38,510 --> 00:28:39,270
Young Marshal.

437
00:28:39,270 --> 00:28:40,470
Is this appropriate?

438
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:43,340
Since you're not afraid of death,

439
00:28:43,550 --> 00:28:45,480
you won't need the antidote anymore.

440
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:46,340
Take them away.

441
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:46,930
Yes, sir.

442
00:28:47,830 --> 00:28:48,640
No need!

443
00:28:48,640 --> 00:28:49,350
Get up!

444
00:28:49,750 --> 00:28:50,610
Young Marshal.

445
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,260
Take them away.

446
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:04,040
Young Marshal Li sent his men
to the pharmaceutical factory?

447
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:07,270
I saw it with my own eyes.

448
00:29:08,270 --> 00:29:09,800
Li Boze is ruthless enough.

449
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:12,030
Ordinary folks can't possibly endure

450
00:29:12,030 --> 00:29:15,090
the human experiments
at the pharmaceutical factory.

451
00:29:17,030 --> 00:29:18,230
If he isn't ruthless,

452
00:29:18,310 --> 00:29:20,710
how can he work for
the Chamber of Commerce?

453
00:29:22,030 --> 00:29:24,680
I really underestimated him.

454
00:29:25,030 --> 00:29:26,160
Before,

455
00:29:26,310 --> 00:29:27,480
I just thought

456
00:29:27,590 --> 00:29:29,270
he was afraid of death.

457
00:29:29,830 --> 00:29:30,750
It seems

458
00:29:31,510 --> 00:29:33,480
he still has some courage.

459
00:29:35,830 --> 00:29:37,270
Being able to work for you

460
00:29:37,510 --> 00:29:38,830
is his luck.

461
00:29:44,270 --> 00:29:45,240
In a few days,

462
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:47,140
for the joint meeting,

463
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:49,550
notify him to attend too.

464
00:29:50,070 --> 00:29:51,640
In the coming days,

465
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:54,740
you must keep a close eye on him for me.

466
00:29:55,830 --> 00:29:56,560
Understood.

467
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:02,480
The pharmaceutical factory

468
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:05,030
is the foundation of our plan.

469
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:08,590
Not a single word of this

470
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,640
can leak out.

471
00:30:20,310 --> 00:30:21,170
Young Marshal.

472
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:22,350
We've searched everywhere

473
00:30:22,350 --> 00:30:24,110
but found no sign of Murong Qingyi's body.

474
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:26,110
Miss Ren took him away with a group of

475
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:28,270
aviation school students and teachers.

476
00:30:28,270 --> 00:30:29,200
Send more men.

477
00:30:29,720 --> 00:30:30,920
Make sure you find them.

478
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:31,650
Understood.

479
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,490
As for the aviation school,

480
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:36,030
the able-bodied

481
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:39,440
are being detained
and negotiated with by the Zhang family,

482
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,750
while the sick and weak

483
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:42,320
have all been dismissed.

484
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:43,830
As for the assets,

485
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:46,310
Zhang Mingshu has taken over everything,

486
00:30:46,310 --> 00:30:48,110
keeping a particularly close watch
on the aircraft.

487
00:30:48,110 --> 00:30:49,840
The Zhang family are all there.

488
00:30:50,270 --> 00:30:51,590
We have followed your orders

489
00:30:51,590 --> 00:30:53,850
and tried our best to make arrangements.

490
00:30:54,510 --> 00:30:55,040
Go ahead.

491
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:55,770
Yes, sir.

492
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:29,680
-Principal!
-Principal!
